    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d597">

                <pb facs="0782" n="688" sameAs="frus:frus1896/pg688"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Olney to Mr.
                            Taylor.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1896-10-09"><hi rendition="#italic">October 9,
                        1896</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Referring to Department’s Nos. 568 and 576 and to your 524, press urgently for
                    orders to allow shipment tobacco embargoed in Cuba.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Olney.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
